<h2><a href="/faq.html">SCIENCE HOBBYIST SITE F.A.Q.</a></h2>longwinded miscellany, webmaster hints

<hr>

<br><h2>Major Website Sections Here:</h2>

<ul>
<li><a href="/sitemap.html">Site Map</a>, also
<a href="/search.html#popu1">list by popularity</a> 
and <a href="/news.html">list by date</a> 
<li><strong><a href="/amasci.html">AMATEUR SCIENCE</a></strong>
, links collection, hobbyist resources, articles, organizations, fellow
amateurs, sources of equipment & surplus
<li><strong><a href="/amateur/coolsci.html">
COOL SCIENCE</a></strong>, links collection, mostly links to the large, commercial
"cool science" indexes, plus my own "coolsci" collection.
<li><strong><a href="/weird.html">WEIRD SCIENCE</a></strong>
, subpages full of articles ranging from unusual to crack-brained.  Pages
and pages full of link collections.
<li><strong><a href="/tesla/tesla.html">TESLA COIL PAGE</a></strong>
, some articles and SW on coil building, plus lots of links to fellow
"coilers" and sites.
<li><strong><a href="/weird/wclose
.html">CLOSEMINDED SCIENCE</a></strong>, articles and links on science ethics and critical thinking about science and skeptics
<li><strong><a href="/scied.html">SCIENCE DEMOS</a></strong>, some of my more complicated science projects, 
links to physics edu. sites (part of SAS)
<li><strong><a href="/edu.html">EDUCATION RESOURCES</a></strong>, 
large links collection of other science edu. websites
<li><strong><a href="/amateur/elehob.html">ELECTRONICS HOBBYIST</a></strong>, links collection,
resources for the electronics nerd, links to fellow tinkerers
<li><strong><a href="/home.html">HOME SCHOOLING LINKS</a></strong>, links collection
<li><strong><a href="/miscon/miscon.html">IS YOUR TEXTBOOK <i>WRONG?</i></a></strong>, my articles about "communicable" errors which infest some textbooks.
<li><strong><a href="/museum.html">SCIENCE MUSEUMS</a></strong>, links collection
, also info about webhead-L
<li><strong><a href="/feynman.html">RICHARD FEYNMAN</a></strong>, links collection
 to sites about this personal hero of mine

<li><strong><a href="/mistake.html">WEBPAGE DESIGN FLAWS</a>,</strong> links collection
 to many "top ten webpage mistakes" sites
<li><strong><a href="/billb.html">BILL B. PERSONAL</a></strong>, author photo, info, Seattle links
<li><strong><a href="/bookstr.html">BOOKSTORE</a></strong>,
Amazon bookstore, tryin' to make a few bucks for THE SCIENCE CLUB nonprofit
<li><strong><a href="/awards.html">AWARDS</a></strong>, links collection
</ul>

